The LEVELS qualifier you are referring to is where do you want nethack 
to store the level information for the levels created in your game, not 
NetHack's levels.  As you play NetHack creates a file for each level 
you have visited, for a number of reasons.  If you shell out of the 
game and check your c:\nethack\levels directory you will find a bunch 
of level files.  All of the NetHack distribution files should go in the 
listed directories.

